 "level_notes": {"1": "Defined by the Modula-3 report (DEC SRC Research Report 31, 1988; revised as Report 52, 1989; published in Nelson's 'Systems Programming with Modula-3'). The CM3 project hosts an HTML edition of the definition with one page per section, linked here.", "0": "Critical Mass Modula-3 (CM3), the descendant of DEC SRC Modula-3, is maintained on GitHub (modula3/cm3); its front end is m3-sys/m3front, the runtime and base libraries are m3-libs/m3core and libm3. PM3 (Polytechnique Montreal) is an older fork."},
